d County","/arc-plc/pennsylvania/bradford-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Bradford County has 75 years of record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, and April to May came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 61% of normal in August to September and 139% in April to May. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 63% and March to April at 154%.</p>"}
